CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Arts & Culture\,Providence\,United States
DESCRIPTION:This workshop is an introduction to business\, industry\, and 
 competitor intelligence research using the tools and databases available t
 hrough Brown University Library. We’ll cover how to find company informa
 tion\, benchmark industry trends and market size\, and track competitor st
 rategy through news\, analyst reports\, and trade publications. Rather tha
 n a database-by-database tour\, we’ll organize the session around real r
 esearch questions and build a repeatable process you can apply to any comp
 any or industry. By the end\, you’ll know which sources to reach for dep
 ending on your question\, how to cross-check and triangulate information f
 rom multiple databases\, and how to move efficiently from a va\nCategory: 
 Arts & Culture\nOriginal listing: https://events.brown.edu/library/event/3
 39551-deep-dive-applied-business-industry-and-competitor-in
LOCATION:Library\, Brown University\, Providence\, RI
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://events.brown.edu/library/event/339551-deep-dive-applied-busine
 ss-industry-and-competitor-in
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:brown-arts
END:VEVENT
