DTEND;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261105T170000
DTSTAMP:20261106T065326Z
UID:0edcae194c3648443faaa31d650a@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Arts & Culture\,Washington\, DC\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Curious about studying abroad in South Korea? Come experience 
 a taste of Korea right here at GW Engineering! Join us for an interactive 
 afternoon featuring Korean food and snacks\, matcha and coffee\, hands-on 
 cultural activities\, and firsthand stories from GW students who have stud
 ied abroad in Korea. Learn about study abroad opportunities at Korea Unive
 rsity\, discover scholarship opportunities\, and connect with students and
  organizations that can help you start planning your own journey abroad.\n
 Category: Arts & Culture\nOriginal listing: https://calendar.gwu.edu/event
 /from-seoul-to-seh-2026
