DESCRIPTION:The Institute for Middle East Studies is proud to announce a s
 creening of the award winning documentary Inside Gaza \, followed by remar
 ks from film director Hélène Lam Trong and featured journalist Mai Yaghi
 . Since the Hamas attack on 7 October 2023 and the Israeli reprisals that 
 followed\, international journalists and media have no access to the Gaza 
 Strip. Agence France-Presse journalists\, who were permanently stationed 
 in Gaza\, were among the last independent witnesses to the abuses committe
 d in the hellscape that Gaza has become. Featuring previously unseen foota
 ge and testimony from reporters Mai Yaghi and Adel Zaanoun\, as well as ph
 otojournalists Mahmud Hams and Mohammed Abed\, Inside G\nCategory: Exhibit
 ion\nOriginal listing: https://calendar.gwu.edu/event/inside-gaza-film-scr
 eening-discussion
