 ates
DESCRIPTION:Join the Institute for Public Diplomacy and Global Communicati
 on (IPDGC) for an event featuring Lithuanian Ambassador H.E. Mr. Gediminas
  Varvuolis. This event is the latest in "Engaging America\," our monthly s
 eries hosting international ambassadors to discuss their country's approac
