  presidential election. These parallel milestones provide a unique lens fo
 r examining how democratic identity\, institutional resilience\, and cross
 ‑Strait geopolitics shape electoral behavior in both polities. In the Un
 ited States\, midterm dynamics reflect heightened economic anxieties\, ris
