 ’ bill\, and the June GAO report assessing the current law. Our panelist
 s\, Peter Brandt and Zack Strong\, along with moderator Francesca Celino\,
  comprise the next installation of our Adjunct Teachers in Animal Law seri
 es. Register for the Webinar Here\nCategory: Lectures & Speakers\nOriginal
